"<xref linkend=\"geocode-glib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libsoup3\"/>, and <xref linkend=\"pygobject3\"/>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"geocode-glib\"/>, <xref linkend=\"gtk3\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"libsoup3\"/> e <xref linkend=\"pygobject3\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:81
#, xml-text
msgid "Recommended"
msgstr "Recomendadas"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:83
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"&gobject-introspection;, <xref linkend=\"libxml2\"/>, and <xref "
"linkend=\"vala\"/>"
msgstr ""
"&gobject-introspection;, <xref linkend=\"libxml2\"/> e <xref "
"linkend=\"vala\"/>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><bridgehead>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:88
#, xml-text
msgid "Optional"
msgstr "Opcionais"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:90
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (gi-docgen is also provided as a meson "
"subproject, which will be used if <option>-Dgtk_doc=false</option> is not "
"passed to <command>meson</command>), <xref linkend=\"llvm\"/> (for clang-"
"format), and <ulink url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pylint/\">pylint</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"gi-docgen\"/> (gi-docgen também é fornecido como um "
"subprojeto meson, que será usado se <option>-Dgtk_doc=false</option> não for"
" passado para <command>meson</command>), <xref linkend=\"llvm\"/> (para "
"formato clang) e <ulink "
"url=\"https://pypi.org/project/pylint/\">pylint</ulink>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:102
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of libgweather"
msgstr "Instalação do libgweather"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:105
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>libgweather</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>libgweather</application> executando os seguintes "
"comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:109
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -Dgtk_doc=false     \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr       \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release \\\n"
"            -Dgtk_doc=false     \\\n"
"            ..                  &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:119
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar construir a "
"documentação da API para esse pacote, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:123
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"s/libgweather_full_version/'libgweather-&libgweather-version;'/\" \\\n"
"    -i ../doc/meson.build                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -Dgtk_doc=true                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"s/libgweather_full_version/'libgweather-&libgweather-version;'/\" \\\n"
"    -i ../doc/meson.build                             &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -Dgtk_doc=true                        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:129
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One test needs that the locale files be installed on the system, so it is "
"better to run the tests after installing the package."
msgstr ""
"Um teste precisa que os arquivos de localidade estejam instalados no "
"sistema, de forma que é melhor executar os testes depois de instalar o "
"pacote."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:134
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:137
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/gnome/platform/libgweather.xml:140
